      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{65ae0f6f7f4ab91561821897|full_name}: I had a stroke reading that- but I just don't want every single person to be nosey in my business and I'm sure others agree. Especially as a creator, not everyone wants the option to be stalked. Someone who wants to be left alone and hang out with a few close friends... could very easily be harassed by someone joining off of a mutual only because they know they are mutuals or getting to know said mutual to use or get something from someone. They'd be forced to live in invite only worlds if it became a personal issue. It's just annoying. Obviously wouldn't affect everyone, but that's why we have settings. If there was a toggle to make it public, friends only, or off, that would be very nice.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
